Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:53.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《绝地战警2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:31.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（毒品实验室 阿姆斯特丹）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.94,0:01:17.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿姆斯特丹港）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 一切都在掌握中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ja, all this is under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:23.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迈阿密 佛罗里达州）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.40,0:01:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一亿五千万美元和我的毒品就要到手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred and fifty million dollars and my dope is on the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天会是一个好日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is gonna be a good day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:49.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（墨西哥湾）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在北纬25度 西经84度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are 25 degrees north, 84 degrees west.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.85,0:01:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,货正被抛下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cargo's being dropped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.85,0:02:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.35,0:02:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想看看他的枪吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to see his gun? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰 砰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bang. Bang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Johnny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking bitches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,红外线探测到水面上有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}lnfrared's got a live one on the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,空军「种马」号C-14报告海岸警卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air Force Stallion C-14 to Coast Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现一个目标正朝南佛罗里达350地区快速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a fast- moving contact heading 3- 5- 0 toward South Florida.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 空军「种马」号发现一个目标正从180方位迅速接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, Air Force Stallion has a contact at 1- 8- 0 closing fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是海岸警卫队勇敢者号 要求说明你们的航行意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Coast Guard cutter Valiant. Request to know your intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,左前方的船 我们是美国海岸警卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}VesseI off our port bow, this is U.S. Coast Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,截距180 速度17节\N{\fnArial\fs30}lntercept is 1- 8- 0, speed 17 knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.79,0:03:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 伙计们 直升机起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it so, chief. Scramble the helo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,前方船只 请减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}VesseI off our port bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是美国海岸警卫队\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is U.S. Coast Guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在请说明你们的意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request to know your intentions at this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,接入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢者 勇敢者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valiant, Valiant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海岸警卫队6003号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Coast Guard 6- 0- 0- 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去目标 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative contact with target. Over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 目标失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, we've lost target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:48.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯太奥特镇 距迈阿密五英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的货和报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your delivery and payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 货已装上迪克西七号 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cargo is on Dixie 7. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 TNT小组 再说一遍 你们给我听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, TNT, for the millionth time, listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从911以来 我们已经在水域方面加强了高科技监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since 9-11, we've gone hi-tech over water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.17,0:04:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒品走私减少了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dope runners have gone low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的线人说有史以来最大的一宗交易今晚抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our source says the biggest X shipment on record arrives tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找出谁是幕后主使\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we want to know who's behind it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.77,0:04:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望几小时后我们就能找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully in a few hours we'll have our answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.78,0:04:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将从三个方向进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll hit from three directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支水上小分队 一支汽车武装 还有些人步行进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go in with a water team, vehicle assauIt and we got guys on foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们的卧底确认毒品后呼叫我们 我们才能行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot make a move untiI our UCs have lD'd the drugs and called us in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有呼叫 我们就撤退 我们将面对的这群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No call, we back away. And these guys we're going after…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有很多武器 而且他们憎恨法律\N{\fnArial\fs30}they got a lot of firepower and they hate the law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们每个人到了那儿都要当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So eyes open out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,B组正在接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo's on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意 目标来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up. Here comes the drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.34,0:05:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 太亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. My lens is flaring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该死的什么都看不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,弟兄们 都到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers! Gather around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.85,0:05:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么不告诉我这儿有个聚会？- 谁管呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't you say there was a rally? - Who's looking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿着那该死的 我走了 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take that shit. I'm out of here. - Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 白色力量 - 白色力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}- White power! - White power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色力量 兔崽子们 迈阿密警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue power, motherfuckers. Miami PD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.47,0:06:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 该死的 是黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, damn. It's the Negroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡斯帕 放下包 A组队长 把人带进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casper, drop the bag. Alpha leader, bring them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坏男孩 - 坏男孩 你们想要做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bad boys, - bad boys What you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来后你们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna do When we come for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计 你该背背歌词 - 我们通常是在合唱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude, you gotta learn the words. - We usually only do the chorus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,A组队长 进攻吧 带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha leader, hit it. Bring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat your transmission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,A组呼叫B4 请继续传话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alpha leader to Bravo Four, please continue relay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,后援在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's backup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- A组队长 快把他人带进来 快 - 迈克 只是有静电干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alpha leader, bring them in. Hit it. - Mike, I'm only getting static.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是静电干扰 这该死的无线电\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all static. The radios are fucked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好笑吗？啊？- 迈克 他们在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something funny? Something funny? - Mike, where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.65,0:06:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了 黑鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you, nigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来有情况了 - 你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looks like we got us a situation here. - You won't shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:07:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为用枪指着他的头 我就不会把你们打个稀巴烂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a gun to his head, so you think I won't splatter you all over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.39,0:07:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我搭挡今晚来这儿就已经准备好送死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner came here tonight prepared to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.43,0:07:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 嗨 噢 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell…hell, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样废物 早准备好死了 是吧 马库斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}lncinerating trash like you. Ready to die, right, Marcus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死的我干嘛想死啊？- 小子 怕了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The fuck I want to do that for? - Scared, ain't you, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择A：把枪放下 告诉我是谁给了你那该死的毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}A: Put the gun down, tell me who brings this shit in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我会朝你的肩膀开一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe I'll just pop one in your shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者B：继续逞英雄 然后我会给你胸口来一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or B: Keep acting all Brody and I'll put one in your chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.28,0:07:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或C：你知道 我们可以坐下来谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or C: You know, take the time to talk a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,缓和一下气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, de- escalate the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.92,0:07:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧 我搭挡又开始说胡话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's my partner's new spirituaI bulIshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我 则更喜欢用枪说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? I actually prefer shooting motherfuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,动静可真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of movement going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不见卧底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't see the UCs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.73,0:07:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得出事了 - 先别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think something's going down. - Don't move yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.33,0:07:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 这人正用枪顶着我的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, the man has a gun to my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝他眼睛打个洞他就会把枪放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll put it down if a hollow point's in his eye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搭挡是个自负的黑鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your partner's a cocky nigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 非得这样吗 伙计？- 看到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn. Now, was that necessary, sir? - See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能仅仅当个警察 他还必须是个黑鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't just be a cop? He got to be a nigga too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做了这傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hot this fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈克 冷静一下 - 冷静？我很冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Calm down. - Calm down? I'm calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很冷静 嗨 哇喔 哇喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calm! Hey! Whoa! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也听不下去他的这些废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am way too unstable for that bulIshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的别乱动 都不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop all the goddamned movement! Everybody stop moving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.59,0:08:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能把你们都放走 但我们会在法庭上想办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't let you all go, but this shit'll get worked out in court.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有自己的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got our rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就先用权利闭上你那该死的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exercise your right to shut the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 警告你们 我能为你们做的只有这么多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right. I'll give you a warning. It's the best I can do for all of youse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？这家伙疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? He's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你三秒钟 把枪放下 先生 - 他有脾气暴躁的毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got 3 seconds to drop your gun. - He has anger issue problems!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一 - 所以他很每天很早睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One. - He goes to bed early for this shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为的就是起床后能杀他个屁滚尿流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to wake up to pop one in a motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二 - 迈克 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two! - Mike, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock 'n' roll! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了这些条子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them cops!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.29,0:09:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.69,0:09:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上 上 快上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go! Go! Come on, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趴下 - 放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down! - Drop the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我什么也没干 - 举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't do shit! - Get your hands up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.37,0:10:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的无线电坏了 叫些医生来 你们还好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The radios were fucked up. Get some medics over here. You guys okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.01,0:10:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 我们还好 - 「我们」？你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, we're fine. - What you mean, "we"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人该死地在我屁股上打了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker shot me in the ass, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.21,0:10:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁朝你屁股开枪？- 谁？就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who shot you in the ass? - Who? That "who" would be you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.45,0:10:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？我打中了你？- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? I shot you? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我开了枪 是的 而且开了很多枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was shooting. Yeah, I did a lot of shooting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并不是说我射了你的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I ain't saying I shot you in the ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我并没有射你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't saying I didn't shoot you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 哦 天啊 你的屁股被人打烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, damn! Somebody shot you in the ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得给我说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.93,0:10:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 伙计 感觉如何？- 火辣辣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yo, man, how's it feel? - It's hot, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能闻到屁股烧焦的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can smell my ass burning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 你该亲它一下 就会好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, you should give it a little kiss so it'll feeI better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.54,0:10:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当我们不在好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretend like we're not even here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 瑞奇·马丁不是在开演唱会吗？快滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, isn't Ricky Martin having a concert? Get the fuck on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.61,0:10:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计 你老把问题扯到种族主义上去 - 你真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You always gotta go racial, man. - It's sad, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想没事的 伙计 只打到了肉上 离你的洞洞还远着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's cool. It hit the meat. It ain't nowhere near the hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有两个小包？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two lousy bags?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,从阿姆斯特丹运来的最大一批货呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the biggest shipment of ecstasy to come out of Amsterdam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.40,0:11:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先照看下我的搭挡 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me worry about my snitch, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,出动了那么多人却一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lot of cop work for nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把你送回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your ass home somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚警察抓了我的运货人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight la policia jacked my mules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来告诉我这些条子是怎么得到消息的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can tell me how those jackaIs knew where to bite Johnny Tapia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.15,0:11:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak up, cousins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很走运 他们没发现迪克西七号上的毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky they did not find my drugs on Dixie 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备换船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change the boat schedule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 强尼 周四我们还有批货要到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't. We got a shipment Thursday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到后再换 让他们慢慢猜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change it after. Just keep them guessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 不像你 我老爸可没留一大笔钱给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, unlike you, my daddy didn't leave me no trust fund.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.47,0:11:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得自己挣钱养活自己 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got real- world shit to deal with, Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来找刺激的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in it for the thrilIs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是这老一套的鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old shit, different day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是的 该死 是我射了你 行了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, yes, damn. I shot you, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.82,0:11:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我不开枪 你现在就什么都看不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd be seeing nothing at all if I hadn't made my move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你为什么发那么大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why you acting so angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:11:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 你搞错了 我没生气 - 不 你很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're misinformed. I'm not angry. - No, you're very angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.99,0:12:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很生气 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are angry. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.83,0:12:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没生气 只要你别再不停地说「你生气了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not angry. Except when you keep repeating "you're angry."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真该死的烦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shit's fucking annoying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像烤肉会上乱七八糟的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a fucking gnat at a barbecue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的把我烦得够呛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just bugging the fuck out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我要你跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I want you to say:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生气了 没关系 我会控制自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm angry. It's okay. I'll process my anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.85,0:12:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love myseIf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the fuck you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你知道我在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you do know what the fuck I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.76,0:12:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才需要那治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that needs therapy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做过那治疗 - 啥时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did my therapy. - When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.03,0:12:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那次在机场擅自开枪后 霍华德警长让我去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capt. Howard made me do it after I shot them people at the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕比 那是「爸爸」的意思 对吧？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Papi. That's "daddy, " right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 你去治疗是为了解决你的心理问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, you go to therapy to get your issues worked out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是为了上你的治疗师\N{\fnArial\fs30}not bang your therapist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瞧 你又开是说下流话了 - 我得生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See, now you just talking nasty. - I gotta survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得开始爱护自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta start loving me for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那听起来像是集体治疗里用的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sound like that group thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许我是参加过一两次集体治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I did the group thing once or twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.97,0:13:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一帮人在一起拥抱 亲吻 就像在搞什么恶心的宗教仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bunch of men hugging and kissing, that's some cult shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,买了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理他 医生 他只是在小题大作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignore him, doc, he's blowing this out of proportion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的屁股可不是什么小题 知道吗 迈克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My ass is what's out of proportion, Mike, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿可少了一大块肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a big chunk missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.46,0:14:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上就一小块而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually a small chunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我们关系中加入这种紧张气氛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This tension you bringing into this relationship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,从长远来看是极为不利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't be healthy in the long run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许根本不会长远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there ain't gonna be no long run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脑子有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's seeing a shrink. I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冰锥 我是劳瑞 - 嗨 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Icepick, Lowrey. - Hey, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两袋 你让我在自己人面前丢光了脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two bags? You embarrassed me in front of my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.71,0:15:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 兄弟 不不不 伙计 等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, brother. No, no, no, brother. Wait, wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 你最好去做个祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. You better pray to whoever it is you pray to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为在我找到你之前 你只有24小时去找那批货了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you got 24 hours to find that X before I find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.63,0:15:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察袭击了我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cops hit my mule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔皮亚先生 我也不知道消息是怎么泄露的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr. Tapia, I don't know where the heat is coming from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们来说事情都有些蹊跷 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a delicate situation for both of us, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 我都查过他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, I've checked them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.84,0:15:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿里克斯 看 有个家伙吸毒过量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, look. A guy's OD'ing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我现在得挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I gotta hang up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个混蛋想随便死在我这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some fucking punk thinks he can die in my club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死迷药简直要了他们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ecstasy fucks them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他从这儿弄出去 约瑟夫 - 把他扔到垃圾堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him out of here, Josef. - We'll dump him around the block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dump him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.92,0:16:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮姑姑 一个年轻的单身女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auntie Syd, it must be so cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自住在纽约一定很酷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young, single, living in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许身边有一大群的帅小伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably hook up with a lot of cute guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.76,0:16:28.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,就像《欲望都市》里的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like Sex and the City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎 你该停了那该死的有线电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theresa, canceI the damn cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 西德妮姑姑 你也是个警察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Auntie Syd, you're a cop too, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.66,0:16:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,算半个 我为毒品缉查局工作 但只是做做文书什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of. I work for the DEA, but I just push a lot of papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没什么好兴奋的 - 你还是继续做你的文书好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing exciting. - Well, you keep pushing papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我就不用为我妹妹和犯罪打交道而担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have to worry about my little sister fighting crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.61,0:16:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly getting hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 把我的镙丝刀拿来 该死的镙栓\N{\fnArial\fs30}James. Get my screwdriver. Damn bolts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理他 因为受了伤 他现在变得很刻薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignore him. He's being mean because he got injured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.78,0:16:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？- 他的伤没事 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - His wound is fine. It's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.15,0:16:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 某些地方被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}other things that were affected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特丽莎 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Theresa! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 只是些神经受了伤 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You- It's just nerve damage, that's all.{\r}
