Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个医疗用具\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a medicaI thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.51,0:17:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一个孕妇商店里买来的 你知道孕妇们常用它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it from a maternity store. You know, pregnant women use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把臀部的一半放在这儿 那样就能减轻另一半的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can put one cheek here. It take pressure off the other cheek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给你的 伙计 - 想得真周到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For you, dog. - Thoughtful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚 我从你眼里看到了某些不一样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}last night there was something different in your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有神灵在保护 迈克 你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mike, I had an epiphany. You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我意识到你是个神秘的家伙 - 是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I realized you're an enigma. - Yeah, I could see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝派你来考验我 但你猜怎么着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}God sent you here to test me. But guess what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁灭不了我 迈克 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You not gonna break me, Mike. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.01,0:17:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是西德妮吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Syd?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 是西德妮 - 现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's Syd. - Now's not a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 听着 现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, listen, now's not a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔过来 传给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me, hit me, hit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在房间里传球\N{\fnArial\fs30}No throwing balIs in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 特丽莎 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up, Theresa? - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他们没告诉我有烤芋头叶吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, they ain't tell me it was a luau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 西德妮 等等 别急 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Syd, hold up. Hold up. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意点 女士 嗨 等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behave yourseIf, girl. Hey, hold up. Hold up. Hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.77,0:18:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 看看你 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at you. Look at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.41,0:18:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好了 好了 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay. Okay. I see now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没把纽约的事告诉马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell Marcus about New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他知道的 那我们呢？- 我们俩的事你说了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He knows about New York. - About us? You told him about us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但他知道纽约的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he knows about New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道那是个好地方 上个月我还和一个证人睡了一觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's a nice city and that I dropped a witness off last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克的嘴可真甜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike is so sweet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太甜会把你的牙蛀坏的 - 你告诉他了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So sweet he make your teeth rot. - So have you told him yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 马上 好吗？我马上告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, soon, okay? Real soon.{\r}
