Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:18:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,特丽莎 时机很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theresa, timing is everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在马库斯正生我气呢 可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus is not very happy with me right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 西德妮 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Syd, I'm telling you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.08,0:19:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个一瘸一拐的家伙 现在可正在气头上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is Scarface limping around in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得给他点时间 让他的屁股好好恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to give that boy a few minutes to let his butt heaI up good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们彼此相爱 还有什么大不了的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We like each other. What's the big deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就去告诉他 我不想再隐瞒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna go tell him right now, because this is dumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 还是我来说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up. Hold up. I'm gonna tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会不告诉他的 我怎么可能隐瞒呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't like I won't tell him. How am I not tell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.31,0:19:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几时？- 给我一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - I need a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我和他之间还有点小误会 再给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight up. We're not vibing right now. I just need a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 他是我哥哥 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, he's my brother, okay?{\r}
