Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 你哥有些不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… There's something wrong with your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 听说你上个月去了纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Mike, I understand you were in New York last month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还记得我做的事吗？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Remember I did the thing? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.36,0:19:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩真该在一起 你们很相配\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of you should've gotten together. That would've been nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 我从没告诉过你 迈克去过纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told you Mike was in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:19:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你知道吗 迈克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what, Mike?{\r}
