Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.51,0:20:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如带她到处看看 那一定很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you show her around? That'd be nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be so great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是 行 呃 马库斯 我和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I could- Well, me and…{\r}
