Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 因为我是来镇里度假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, because I'm in town on vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住在一个最棒的旅馆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying at the most amazing hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那景色 那游泳池 哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The view, the pool. Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这儿也有游泳池\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a pooI right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.46,0:20:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 那个不算游泳池\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't exactly a pool, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是个用蓝塑胶布围起来的小坑坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like a big- ass puddle wrapped in blue plastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.67,0:20:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 你买这房子的时候 就没有像样点的游泳池？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't they have any good pools when you bought this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根 这泳池花了我3900美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan, that pool cost $3900.{\r}
