Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 行了 亲爱的 - 那要好大一笔钱呢 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all right, baby. - It is kind of whack, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.81,0:20:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有个约会 很高兴再次见到你 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go meet somebody. It was nice seeing you again, Mike.{\r}
