Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么总是像这儿的主人一样跑过来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you gotta always come over here and try to take over, Mike?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么？- 伙计 这是我的家 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - This is my family, man. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底在说什么啊？- 我宁静的港湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - My place of peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.28,0:21:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃药了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you taking medication?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得按时吃药 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taking medicine for the thing, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怎么了？- 算了 忘了它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd I do? - Forget it. Just forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.75,0:21:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我做什么了？- 马森 去把它捡回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd I do? - Mason. Go fetch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.43,0:21:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that shit is funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.07,0:21:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真该死的有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some funny shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 伙计 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.31,0:21:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我是劳瑞 怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Lowrey, you hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,3900美元 3900美元啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty- nine hundred dollars. Thirty- nine hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.24,0:21:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你最好向上帝祈祷 嗨 伙计 快把自己擦干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better pray to God you right this time. Yo, dry off, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.11,0:21:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰锥说海地帮要去打劫 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}lcepick said the Haitian Zoepounds about to do a rip. Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.43,0:22:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 机灵点 跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, smarten up. Talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.27,0:22:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes on, agents. Good luck.{\r}
