Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这儿看得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a good look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.11,0:22:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的视野很好 - 好吧 我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got a good eyeball. - All right, we're in.{\r}
