Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.74,0:22:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.17,0:22:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你们要想把这些都运走就得快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. If you want to move this stuff you gotta do it quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.91,0:22:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 设备不错啊 你可以开始点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, nice getup. You can start to run these through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你的家伙如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see how your machine works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.85,0:23:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 好像这听上去有点黄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, that sounded dirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你的家伙如何？宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I would like to see how your machine works, baby."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实并不粗俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be so crude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 实际上我很高雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm more of a refined kind of a human being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.26,0:23:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跳芭蕾吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You follow ballet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有三个表妹在莫斯科的波尔肖大剧院跳芭蕾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of my cousins are dancing with the Bolshoi Theatre in Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢嘻哈音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like hippie- hop too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了五千块\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you 5000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只给了我四千九\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me 4900.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.08,0:23:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给了你五千块 - 四千九\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gave you 5000. - 4900.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.12,0:23:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五千块 - 再数数\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 5000. - Count it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再跟我耍花招 就找别人交易去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to fuck with me again, find yourseIf another chump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.52,0:23:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.43,0:23:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几个人？- 三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much? - Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 看看 到处都是钱 快收拾一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Money everywhere. Clean it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.96,0:23:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们要换三百万 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we want to change a little over $3 million, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我的纽约朋友干过多少事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many jobs did you do with my friends up there in New York?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.90,0:23:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.11,0:23:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的态度会影响很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you behave with me has consequences for a lot of people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.38,0:24:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你来找我的 而不是我找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found me, not the other way around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.71,0:24:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我把小面额换成大钞交给第三方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me to change small bilIs to large ones and deliver to a third party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌 他一定很想马上收到钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet he'd like his money in a timely fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果钱迟了 那是你的事 跟我没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delivery's late, it's your ass, not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.97,0:24:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有五万一百元的 换你五万十元的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's 50, 000 in 100s for your 50, 000 in 10s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.10,0:24:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三方的钱装在这五个箱子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third party takes his million in these five briefcases here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.97,0:24:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我希望你没被搞糊涂 老板 - 我讨厌算术\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hope I'm not losing you, chief. - I hate math.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.04,0:24:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮你换了三百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}So for your $3 million that we shrunk for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.88,0:24:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿走应得的二百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get 2 million in clean money back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.25,0:24:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,减去我们应得的三十万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less our percentage: $300, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.38,0:24:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会把这些送到你上家的手里 - 阿里克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be delivering these to your dealer. - Alexei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.22,0:24:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 我们付出的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We're giving too fucking much away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.72,0:24:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有风险都是我们承担的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take all the risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.96,0:24:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的供应商拿走了太多的利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our suppliers take too much of our profit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.83,0:24:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 打电话给上面 我们要重新商量一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll call the general, renegotiate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.90,0:24:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是商人 我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a businessman, we're businessmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.27,0:25:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给他打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, call him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.47,0:25:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我正在送钱的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agents, we're on the move to the money drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.14,0:25:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计 卡车开走了 我们得跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, the truck's leaving. We're going to follow it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lose that truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.42,0:25:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上那卡车 跟上它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow that truck. Follow that truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.47,0:25:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他们上路了 看来冰锥的情报没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, they saddling up. Look like Icepick came through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.07,0:25:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要劫谁的货？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder whose shit they about to rip now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.68,0:26:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎鹰一号 你看见她了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falcon One, do you see her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.55,0:26:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.49,0:26:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想被发现 挨一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to get spotted, take a burn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.49,0:26:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是群海盗 什么都抢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoepound a bunch of pirates, man. SteaI anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.97,0:26:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,十点方向有辆黑色的雪佛兰Suburban\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Suburban at 10 o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 来吧 宝贝儿 停到顶上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, baby. Park it at the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.51,0:26:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯特 她朝你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roberto, she's coming to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.08,0:26:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.79,0:27:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是猎鹰一号 伙计们 我看见她上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Falcon One, guys. I got her coming up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.69,0:27:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了 伙计们 又来了辆橙色的大跑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, guys. I got an orange muscle car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.36,0:27:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来里面有三个黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks to be three black male occupants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.93,0:27:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可没料到 通知他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out of our field of vision. Bring it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.47,0:27:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 注意了 你们后面来了三个不明身份的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, be aware, we got three bogeys unidentified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.88,0:27:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 来了三个可疑的家伙 他们散开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we got three bogeys. They're splitting up. They're moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.92,0:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心了他们正在靠近 该死 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be aware. They're approaching- Shit. Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.35,0:27:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 他开了枪 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck, it's a hit! - Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.67,0:27:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人中枪了 中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent down. Agent down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.44,0:27:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯特 该死快跟上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roberto, fucking follow them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来了 我来了 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm on it! I'm on it! - Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.44,0:27:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.78,0:27:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.32,0:28:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是西德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Syd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.55,0:28:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.23,0:28:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你老妹在里面干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, what is your sister into?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.34,0:28:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,人行道 人行道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sidewalk! Sidewalk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.58,0:29:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 闪开 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.48,0:29:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.59,0:29:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 运河街需要支援 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! - I need backup on Canal, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just get ready to shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.20,0:29:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.97,0:29:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.27,0:29:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 给他看警徽干嘛 他有枪 射他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, your badge?! He has a gun! Shoot him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.19,0:29:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 她有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, she's in trouble, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.70,0:29:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 快让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Get out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.98,0:30:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我就快疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I done just got mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.06,0:30:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪 枪 枪 - 抓住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gun! Gun! Gun! - Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.17,0:30:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 给他们看你的警徽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now show them your badge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.94,0:31:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真该死的疯了 - 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This shit is crazy. - I know, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.61,0:31:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.23,0:31:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,都蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the world down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.82,0:32:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.67,0:32:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,上 上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.81,0:32:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.91,0:32:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, drive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.92,0:32:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.30,0:32:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快 迈克 追上那狗娘养的 追上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, Mike! Punch that shit! Punch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.79,0:33:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了那婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the fucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.60,0:33:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.41,0:33:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.51,0:33:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别丢了她 迈克 - 我正在追呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't lose her, Mike! - This is what I do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.10,0:33:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.43,0:33:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要宰了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely shoot that motherfucker that just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.67,0:33:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 我的车灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, my headlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.87,0:33:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪啊 开枪啊 射 射啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot back! Shoot back! Shoot! Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.45,0:34:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你 你在干什么 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the-?! What are you doing, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.62,0:34:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 是我不好 - 往外射啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's my bad. - Shoot outside!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该死给我小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay attention to what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.84,0:34:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些该死的把链子给解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These dudes is off the chain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.89,0:34:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.33,0:34:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真该死的糟透了 - 是的 一会儿还会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is some sick shit! - Yep, it's about to get sicker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.91,0:35:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out! Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.45,0:35:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sh-!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.75,0:35:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 他们不会那么干了 - 哦 不 又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, they are not about to do that. - Hell, yes, they are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.22,0:35:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.96,0:35:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看见了 他们在扔车 - 我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see that?! - They throwing cars! How can I not?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.81,0:35:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只想帮忙 懂吗 - 你知道怎么帮吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just trying to help, okay?! - You know what'd be fucking helpful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.98,0:35:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的鸟嘴 让我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut the fuck up and let me drive! Let's try that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.42,0:35:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 来啊 伙计 尖叫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, man, with the screaming shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.26,0:35:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要集中精力避开那些该死的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm concentrating on dodging these fuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.30,0:36:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.27,0:36:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 翻过去了 - 那该死的车翻过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was a flip! - That motherfucker flipped!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.41,0:36:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吓我一大跳 - 它差点撞到我的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That one puckered up my butthole. - Almost fucking crushed my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.43,0:36:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.56,0:37:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甩了他们 是的 我把你的货带到了备用交货点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost them. Yeah, I've got your cargo to the backup drop point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.80,0:37:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人注意了 嫌犯仍然在逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention all units, suspects still at large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.14,0:37:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.01,0:37:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事 西德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is going on, Syd?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.98,0:37:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点要了所有人的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some desk you're driving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.48,0:37:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这儿 我是卧底 请叫你的人走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here, I'm undercover. And please call off your dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.79,0:37:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有毒品缉查局的人保护 别砸了我的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got DEA watching my back, so don't blow my case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.95,0:37:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们救了你的命 - 我很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We saved your life. - And I appreciate that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.22,0:37:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不喜欢你们俩像现在这样跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I don't appreciate is you two following me here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.89,0:37:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点砸了一个准备了五个月的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}nearly burning a case that took five months to set up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.80,0:37:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们一直在互相说谎？对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we lie to each other? Is that what we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.40,0:37:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎么办？- 马库斯 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you want me to do? - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.40,0:37:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去死 迈克 她错了 - 冷静一下 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck that, Mike, she's wrong. - Calm down. Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.04,0:37:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 车里有毒品吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Syd, are there drugs in that truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.24,0:37:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是现金 - 给谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's cash. - Where's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.98,0:37:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能告诉你 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't tell you that. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.98,0:37:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那是我的工作 如果我想保住饭碗就必须遵守规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have a career and if I want to keep it, I have rules to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.51,0:38:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.82,0:38:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是我收到命令 无论如何不能把情报透露给迈阿密警方\N{\fnArial\fs30}My orders are, under no circumstances share information with Miami PD…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.52,0:38:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为他们有人泄密 - 哦 那我现在是迈阿密警察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- because they got too many leaks. - Oh. I'm Miami PD now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.12,0:38:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定忘了我还是你哥 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done forgot I'm your big brother, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.23,0:38:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 西德妮 你刚才的行为简直是太鲁莽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Syd, that shit you did was reckless…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.33,0:38:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,又愚蠢 又危险 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was stupid and it was dangerous. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.67,0:38:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要告诉妈妈 知道吗 我一定会把这事说出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling Mommy. Okay? I'm definitely leaking that shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.84,0:38:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Marcus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.61,0:38:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 拜托 他也有他的道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Syd, come on, he got a point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.37,0:38:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother loves you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.38,0:38:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不用说那还是他的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention a little thing called professionaI courtesy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.21,0:38:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闯进了别人的地盘 该让主人知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bouncing in somebody's yard, you should let them know about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.62,0:38:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次用枪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time using your gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.19,0:38:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你干得很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you handled yourseIf very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.39,0:38:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可惜你搭挡没注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad your partner didn't notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.07,0:38:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.63,0:38:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你能轻易脱身？一个你跟了五个月的案子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you get off that easy? You been working this for five months?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.90,0:38:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么在纽约时你没告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you ain't tell me in New York?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.77,0:38:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会说什么？- 我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What would you have said? - I would've…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.81,0:39:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你这工作不好干 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have let you know this job is rugged, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.68,0:39:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很危险 如果你出了什么事 我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous. And if something happen to you I might…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.11,0:39:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我什么都没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly why I didn't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.06,0:39:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人偷了你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's stealing your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.13,0:39:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易完成了 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drop's done. I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.77,0:39:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.62,0:39:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她出事前我们得把这案子解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta close this case before it get her killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.26,0:39:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.03,0:39:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好回局里一趟了吗？我们得给自己擦擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to go back to the station, get our asses whupped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.43,0:39:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we gonna be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.03,0:40:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的任务内容是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your job description?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.17,0:40:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.71,0:40:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的任务内容是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your job description?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.78,0:40:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.35,0:40:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,战术扫毒组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tactical Narcotics Team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.55,0:40:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键字是 战术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keyword: "tactical"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.65,0:40:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,运用精妙的战术取得胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Displaying finesse and subtlety in achieving a goal!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.33,0:40:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, gentlemen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.99,0:40:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天你们的精妙战术体现在哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was subtle about your work today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.87,0:40:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十二辆汽车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-two cars…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.91,0:40:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一艘游艇 就这些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a boat, totaled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.48,0:40:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是怎么把那艘游艇弄沉的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you sink a boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.51,0:40:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没把它弄沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't sink it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.26,0:41:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 先说好消息 感谢上帝没有警察牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, the positive. Thank God no cops died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.43,0:41:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息是 有个高级警官一直跟在我屁股后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The negative: I got a police commissioner so far up my ass…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.67,0:41:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么说我就得怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he spits it's coming out of my mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.84,0:41:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道事情总是有两面性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know that there's always two sides to a story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.84,0:41:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 说说你们的故事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.61,0:41:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好的 当时我正在参加个家庭烤肉会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was at a family barbecue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.38,0:41:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到情报 海地帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a tip that the Zoepounders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.42,0:41:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,正准备抢劫一个大佬的钱或者是毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}were gonna do a hit on cash or drugs from this big-time X-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.22,0:41:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把街头毒贩叫做大佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they call a ecstasy dealer on the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.86,0:41:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯 我知道他们怎么这么叫这帮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus, I know what they call them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.19,0:41:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我才是警长 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm captain. It's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.73,0:41:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你们查到了毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got the drugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.60,0:41:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有毒品 哦 好的 那么钱呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No drugs. Oh, okay. All right. How about the money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.37,0:41:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有钱？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No money. - Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.74,0:41:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁是大佬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who is this X-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.61,0:41:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我当时正在举行家庭烤肉会 所以我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I was at a family barbecue. So I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.31,0:41:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道 但我们会查清楚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know, but we are going to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.34,0:41:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那么那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then all that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.51,0:41:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 毫无价值吗？- 那不全都是我们干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- was for nothing? - We didn't do all of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.25,0:41:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你凑近点的话 看 停一下 我来指给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look close-Watch. Hold up. Let me show…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.32,0:42:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是缉毒局的人 等 等等 就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's DEA all over. Wait, the- Wait, hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.16,0:42:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,缉毒局？怎么没有通知我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The DEA? Without consuIting me?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.66,0:42:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 在这儿就有辆他们的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a DEA car right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.26,0:42:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ! Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.16,0:42:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 不 压一压你的穴位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cap. No. Remember your pressure points.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.73,0:42:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我要做做练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do my… My exercises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.57,0:42:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的小弟们叫去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holler at your boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.14,0:42:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,二万一千美元？什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-one thousand? What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.41,0:42:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真该亲亲我的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, kiss my black ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.25,0:42:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的底限了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the dashboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.05,0:42:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道吗？- 好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what? - Better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.39,0:42:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你们会拿到钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you'll get your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.05,0:42:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经派人给你们送钱去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's on they way with your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.13,0:42:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我们是不是来谈谈赔偿损失的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it possible we could discuss potential reimbursement…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.13,0:42:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不赔偿私人财产 这就是为什么我们开的是警车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't cover personaI property. That's why we drive police cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.43,0:42:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where do we go from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.03,0:42:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,海地帮的人知道准确的交货时间和地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoepounders knew exactly when to hit the drop, where to hit the drop…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.20,0:42:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们想他们一定也知道钱在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we figure they know where the cash is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.37,0:42:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到钱的话 就能找到那个大佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find the cash, we find the X- Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.41,0:42:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我可不想参加这游戏 懂吗？我这儿有三个员警生命垂危\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm through playing games, all right? I have three cops critical.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.95,0:42:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这儿每天都有孩子被毒品害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got kids dying on my streets from souped-up X.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.95,0:43:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想让这帮禽兽毁了我的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want these animals taking over my city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.95,0:43:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.29,0:43:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我要你们俩尽你们全力 不惜一切 现在就去办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I want you guys to do whatever you do, whatever it takes, but do it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.80,0:43:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿不太好 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not good, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.64,0:43:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.81,0:43:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的老鼠竟敢咬我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking ratones eating my fucking money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.15,0:43:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛斯 这真是个愚蠢的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlos, this is a stupid fucking problem to have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.02,0:43:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不管怎么说 总是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is a problem nonetheless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.99,0:43:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rat fuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.72,0:43:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rat fuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.00,0:43:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 真他妈疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss, it ended up crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.50,0:43:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个给俄国佬做事的黑妞简直是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This black chica working for the Russians was a maniac lunatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.00,0:43:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救了你的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She saved your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.20,0:43:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她干掉了些海地人 还把货送到了交易点\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasted some Haitians and got the load to the drop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.77,0:43:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 罗伯特看见了这两个黑帮老乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, Roberto saw these two crazy gangbanger homeys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.84,0:44:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 该死 - 发疯似的又追又打\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - Yeah. Chasing and shooting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.31,0:44:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我有过这样的问题吗？没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old days, did I have this problem? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.01,0:44:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把毒品空运进来再把钱用船运走就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fly the drugs in and ship the money out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.39,0:44:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 该死的美国海岸警卫队把水域封得太紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now American security's so goddamned tight over the water…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.82,0:44:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在天上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the sky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.19,0:44:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些老鼠在钱运到古巴前就会把它们吃光的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the rats eat my money before I can get it to Cuba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.36,0:44:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看见了吗？- 火爆撞车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see? - Fiery crash…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.20,0:44:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至连我的钱运过这城市都得弄出点新闻来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even get my money across town without making the news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.64,0:44:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.11,0:44:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.58,0:44:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不是该担心了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}should I be worried?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.24,0:44:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 老板 - 给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, boss. - Shut the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.61,0:44:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在迈阿密 居然有人抢我的货\N{\fnArial\fs30}People is trying to jack my loads here in Miami.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.95,0:44:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拥有这该死的城市 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own this fucking town. You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.25,0:44:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.49,0:44:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天 粉红\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Pink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.09,0:44:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉红 尼娜 粉红色 不是淡蓝色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pink, niсa, pink. Pink. No powder blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.33,0:44:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,粉红的更漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pink is prettier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.70,0:44:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可店里的女士说我看起来像个模特\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the lady at the store said I look like a model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.24,0:45:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运 你的母亲是我母亲的表亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lucky your mother was my mother's cousins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.77,0:45:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理罗伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pay attention to Roberto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.44,0:45:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,此外 模特都是些肮脏的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, modeIs are fiIthy creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.81,0:45:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来更像个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look more like an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.95,0:45:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得呢 卡洛斯？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you think, Carlos? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.92,0:45:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗伯托 你怎么想？- 真漂亮死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roberto, what do you think? - It's fucking beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.65,0:45:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的小甜心前说话文明点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk polite in front of my little bonbon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.93,0:45:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不然我让你断子绝孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I'm gonna chop your balIs off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.80,0:45:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我不介意 你那些精神指引之类的玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}For real, I'm straight with all your spirituaI enlightenment and that shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.67,0:45:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我必须得知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.48,0:45:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有个家伙 拿着把枪向我冲来 你会把那蠢货宰了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if a crackhead rolIs to me with a.9, you'll cook that fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.44,0:45:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我会朝他的腿来上一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No question about it. Shoot him in the leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.84,0:45:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别只是朝腿上打啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on with that leg shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.51,0:45:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每个人都该获得一点起码的尊重 - 可我的尊严呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody deserves a little dignity. - What about my dignity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.78,0:45:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙会失去膝盖骨 而我则会被装到裹尸袋里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your crackhead will be missing a kneecap. I'll be in a body bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.88,0:45:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太悲哀了 - 什么太悲哀了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So sad. - What's so sad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.12,0:45:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的情绪治疗不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your untreated control issues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.95,0:45:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.99,0:45:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell is that supposed to mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.29,0:46:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是婴儿的时候 你妈肯定没让吃她的奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mama probably refused you her tit when you were a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.73,0:46:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你发育不良 只能高中毕业\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grew up a malnourished high-school softie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.67,0:46:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,端着枪 穿着又小又紧的T恤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your gun, little tight T-shirt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.43,0:46:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了一个报复狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and became a overcompensating tough guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.47,0:46:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你以后别再提我妈的奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the last time you will ever refer to my mother's titties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.41,0:46:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至连想都不许想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even want them up in your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.85,0:46:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了那么多话 迈克 可你就听见「奶」\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I said all that, Mike, and all you heard was "titties."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.22,0:46:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你不可能一直控制我的思想 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you can't keep suppressing my spiritual growth, Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.36,0:46:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须把我母亲的「奶」 从你的精神分析里排除出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to suppress my mother's titties out of your psychoanalysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.83,0:46:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要记住一件事 伙计 我不会和你做一辈子搭档的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just remember one thing, my friend. I may not always be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.83,0:46:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 冰锥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Icepick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.67,0:46:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣会指引你 我的兄弟 请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus is the way, my brothers. Step inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.01,0:46:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚在「迈克叔叔」 的黑名单上占据了第一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just went number one on Uncle Mike's shit list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.44,0:46:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们只拿到两小袋毒品 伙计 - 我的兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got two lousy bags, man. - My brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.55,0:46:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,海地人 金色的辫子 他在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haitian blond with dreads. Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.85,0:46:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,金辫子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blondie Dread?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.85,0:46:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这消息可贵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very expensive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.29,0:47:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 还有你 必须为我做点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and you have to do something for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.22,0:47:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你正试图恐吓我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you trying to get gangster on me like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.93,0:47:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 他是在玩恐吓 - 那我们可能该\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, he went gangster. - So we should probably…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.26,0:47:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而我们想做 你明白了吗？- 是的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So we want to do the…You got them? - Yeah, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.93,0:47:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的搭档 我们是迈阿密警局 双人舞蹈组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my partner, we're on the Miami PD tandem dance team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.10,0:47:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有固定的表演套路 我们赢得过所有本地的表演奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a routine. We won all the local talent shows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.60,0:47:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在考虑进入国家队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thinking about going national.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.24,0:47:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想给他展示展示吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to show him some of the routine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.04,0:47:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,热热身 别碰坏了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warm it up. Don't hurt nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.01,0:47:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 喔 看看这个 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, yo, watch this. Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.58,0:47:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏来了 看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This the shit right here. This is the shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.13,0:47:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在我店里干了什么？- 看他这个旋转舞步\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you doing to my shop?! - Watch this spin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.93,0:47:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.13,0:47:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在干什么？- 让我也来露两手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing?! - Oh, give me some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.80,0:47:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会毁我了的店 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're ruining my shop. Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.70,0:47:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来段舞蹈 - 我要把这房子拆掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do the dance thing. - I'm gonna bring the house down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.68,0:47:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.01,0:48:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他住在幢粉红的房子里 离这里八个街区 在卡尔大街\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives in a pink house eight blocks from here on Carl Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.79,0:48:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.96,0:48:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警察 趴下 - 警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Police! Get down. - Police!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.83,0:48:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？谁在我的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who that? Who in my house?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.00,0:48:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是魔鬼 是谁在问？- 魔鬼在这里不受欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm the devil, who's asking?! - The devil is not welcome here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.34,0:48:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚在他的房子里 称呼自己为魔鬼？该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to call yourself the devil in his house?! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.37,0:49:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么敢进我的屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my house!{\r}
