Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.38,0:49:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去死 - 我去死？你去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you. - Fuck me? Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.39,0:49:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You no problem!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.69,0:49:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 你不这么火爆不行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, do you have to be so combative?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.59,0:49:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking-!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.73,0:49:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在骂我婊子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You calling me a bitch?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.90,0:49:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么合作 要么去死 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do or die, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.33,0:49:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑袋来颗子弹 会让你的护照延期\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bullet in the head'll really mess up your extensions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.57,0:49:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的枪子儿吃屎去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your bullet and eat that shit, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.41,0:49:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.91,0:49:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.69,0:49:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我们只是想谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we just want to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.36,0:49:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈谈吗？好吧 来吧 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk?! Well, go ahead. Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.06,0:49:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是移民局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not lmmigration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.83,0:49:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们听不见你说话 因为他们正对着你开火呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't hear you because they're still shooting at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.87,0:50:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的海地人躲在间该死的破房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Haitians in a fucking little-ass room…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.37,0:50:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着该死的枪 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}with fucking guns. Shit!{\r}
