Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.34,1:10:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他的耳朵打烂了 还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You blew his ear off, remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.02,1:10:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你能教我怎么开枪打人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, can you teach me how to shoot people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.45,1:10:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听我们在塔皮亚家搜集到的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to what we got at Tapia's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.03,1:11:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的副手正在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second-in-command is talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.73,1:11:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在说 是的 老板 我们找到了一群肥雌兔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's telling him, "Yes, boss. We found a bunch of fat doe fuckers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.37,1:11:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经筛选好了 - 筛选肥雌兔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and we're getting them emptied." - Fat does emptied?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.47,1:11:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那该死的是什么意思？- 他今天下午有个约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The hell does that mean? - He has a meeting this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.04,1:11:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道我是谁吗？- 名字听起来很熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know who I am? - Name sounds familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.25,1:11:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有幽默感 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sense of humor. I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.98,1:11:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两点在沙滩上见 海岸俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me on the sand, 2:00, Shore Club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.02,1:11:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不知道自己在干嘛 我们开始行动吧 - 你们都跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She has no idea. Let's roll. - Y'all come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.16,1:11:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫了两杯巴卡第莫希多鸡尾酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ordered a couple of Bacardi Mojitos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.71,1:11:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈阿密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miami.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.07,1:11:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 画面九放大 再来点声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, zoom in on nine. A little more audio, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.75,1:11:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们何不游个泳？凉快一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why don't we take a swim? Cool off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.35,1:12:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我们就待在这儿喝个酩酊大醉 怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we could just stay here and get drunk. How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.25,1:12:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们晚点再喝也不迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we could drink this later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.39,1:12:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你有另有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you have a reason…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.39,1:12:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不想弄湿你那性感的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}why you don't want to get that beautiful body of yours wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.53,1:12:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不干脆问我是不是戴了窃听器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not just ask if I'm wearing a wire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.23,1:12:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿去游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather go swimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.47,1:12:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到底在干嘛？- 狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell's he doing? - Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.04,1:12:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 他要带她下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. He's taking her into the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.96,1:12:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.66,1:12:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你替我工作 何必浪费时间在这里无谓的谈话呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to work for me. Why waste time on this unnecessary talking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.73,1:12:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没必要 你需要另一名银行家做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very unnecessary. What do you need with another banker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.24,1:12:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你前雇主的理由一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the same reason as your previous employer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.57,1:12:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我拥有所有的俄国俱乐部 没有中间人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I own all the Russian clubs. No middleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.51,1:13:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将成为北美最大的毒品进口商和分销商\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm about to be the biggest importer and distributor of X in North America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.95,1:13:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为非常有钱的年轻富婆 所以我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be a very rich young woman. That's why I thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.25,1:13:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么 塔皮亚先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you thought, Mr. Tapia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.12,1:13:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你没有顾虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you don't think it more than once…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.79,1:13:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意和你一块儿干\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy to be in business with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.10,1:13:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.10,1:13:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来做生意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.38,1:13:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是警察还是模特儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, a cop or a model?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.78,1:13:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.72,1:13:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便穿穿而已 我喜欢打扮得漂亮点 怎么啦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw something on. I like looking good. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.45,1:13:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,给谁看啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.99,1:13:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别恨对手 恨比赛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hate the player. Hate the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.62,1:13:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨那裁缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the tailor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.96,1:13:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 我们会抓住他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job. We'll get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.96,1:13:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥想跟你谈一谈 在对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother would love to talk to you down the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.66,1:13:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.07,1:14:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想毁了我的案子 还是你疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to blow my case or you just insane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.31,1:14:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是在和古巴疯子打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one taking a dip with the Cubano maniac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.74,1:14:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的？- 我们在房子里装了窃听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you know that? - We had a wire in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.58,1:14:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩有权利在那安装窃听器？- 听着 去它的 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You two have a warrant for that wire? - Look, fuck that, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.12,1:14:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道你身处何种险境 西德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know the kind of danger that you're in, Syd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.09,1:14:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全明白 而且我完全有能力办好我所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fully aware and I am fully capable of what I am doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.59,1:14:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再是你的小妹妹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your baby sister anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.43,1:14:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对缉毒组来说 你仅仅是个花瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the DEA you ain't nothing but a honeypot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.63,1:14:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.93,1:14:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才得到了这份工作 因为你穿起泳装来身材很惹火\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you got the job, because you look good in a bathing suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.80,1:14:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们找个地方坐下来谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's sit down somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.87,1:14:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听着 西德妮 有些事你必须要了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, Syd, there's some shit you need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.34,1:14:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼·塔皮亚在他妈妈的厨房里 剁了俄罗斯的黑帮老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Tapia is cutting up Russian mob bosses in his mom's kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.28,1:14:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在厨房里 西德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the kitchen, Syd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.61,1:14:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在锅子旁边找到了一截手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found a severed finger by the crock pot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.05,1:14:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将卷入一场毒品恶战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're about to be in the middle of a drug war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.35,1:14:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈阿密警探已抓过这家伙十二次 但每次都苦无罪证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miami PD has arrested this guy 12 times with no convictions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.49,1:14:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们何不歇手 让我们来缉捕他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just hang back and let us bring him down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.23,1:14:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 听着 我需要这案子 好吗？我已经很接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, look, I need this, okay? And I am this close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.06,1:14:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个接近法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's "this close"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.30,1:15:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他整个行动中 我负责洗钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in charge of money laundering for his entire operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.40,1:15:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一两个月内 我们就能搜集到足够的罪证 然后他就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln a month or two we'll have enough for a conviction and it'll be over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.87,1:15:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一两天怎么样？听起来更好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about a day or two? Sound better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.67,1:15:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯和我认为 我们发现了塔皮亚整个计划中的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus and I think we found the key to Tapia's whole operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.14,1:15:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在无话可说了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nothing to say now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.08,1:15:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很惊讶 对吧？- 好了 别闹了 你们俩 可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just stuck, right? - Okay, time-out, y'all. Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.25,1:15:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got this peckerwood that'll put us down…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.32,1:15:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道塔皮亚的货最终被运到哪儿 你想加入吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the transport end of Tapia's operation. Do you want in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.06,1:15:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么可以？- 什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would you… - When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.26,1:15:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今晚 - 到时叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tonight. - Page me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.86,1:15:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该带我的皮带吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I bring my thong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.59,1:15:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的脏手放开 我会打得你屁滚尿流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your bitch hands off. I'll knock you the fuck out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.17,1:15:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 我们想办法让她脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, we're trying to keep her out of trouble, man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.34,1:15:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是邀她加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}not invite her in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.37,1:15:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我刚想清楚了 你知道 如果她跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, I just figured, you know, if she with us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.04,1:15:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少麻烦会比较少些\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's just less trouble she could get into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.51,1:15:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要跟你说清楚 伙计 我想她自己能照顾自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep it reaI with you too, man. I think she can handle herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.75,1:15:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也跟你说清楚 没有人比我更了解我妹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep it reaI with you. Don't nobody know my sister like I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.29,1:15:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？她没做出正确的选择 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? She doesn't make good choices, Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.56,1:15:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不是那种很机灵的人 - 没能做出正确的选择？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not street-smart. - Doesn't make good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.59,1:16:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪种选择？- 比如男人 就是其中一项\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like, what kind of choices? - Men, for one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.46,1:16:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,她迷上了这些蠢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's attracted to these dumb…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.96,1:16:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些只有大块肌肉的猪头 迈克 你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}flashy, just musclebound dickheads, Mike. You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.53,1:16:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那帮该死的混蛋们 甚至都没法转身擦自己屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cock diesel motherfuckers that can't even fucking turn to wipe their ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.47,1:16:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 懂我意思吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You feel me? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.14,1:16:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？他们笨得跟一桶虾似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know? Just dumb as a bucket of shrimp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.81,1:16:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对 那样是够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. That shit's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.22,1:16:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你不觉得 也许你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you don't think maybe you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.25,1:16:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你没有 比如说 没有机会好好认识他们一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you didn't, like, get a chance to know any of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.39,1:16:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给下一个人一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna give the next one a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.56,1:16:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他一次抓屁股的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance to whup his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.93,1:16:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫他把屎挖出来 - 你想跟他打架吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whup the shit out of him. - Oh, you gonna fight him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.30,1:16:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做的肯定是非法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm gonna do ain't even gonna be legal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.00,1:16:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后可能会被关在这儿 跟这些混蛋在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might be up in here with these motherfuckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.04,1:16:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂我的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.31,1:16:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该死的看什么看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fuck you looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.14,1:16:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,太感谢你了\N谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you kindly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.24,1:16:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁保释我出来的？- 嗨 佛洛德表弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who sprung me? - Hey, Cousin Floyd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.81,1:16:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 是你 - 记得我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, you. - Remember me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.65,1:17:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.96,1:17:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩合照样子真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all look great together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.46,1:17:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们到底想干嘛？- 只是需要你帮你一点点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck you doing? - Just a little insurance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.86,1:17:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要帮我们找出迪克西七号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna help us find Dixie 7…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.86,1:17:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们那艘船和强尼·塔皮亚有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell us what that boat has to do with Johnny Tapia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.53,1:17:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不是内奸 - 哦 你不是内奸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I ain't no snitch. - Oh, you ain't no snitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.60,1:17:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 糟糕 真遗憾 - 知道我会怎么做吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, damn. That's a shame. - Know what I'm gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.60,1:17:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会寄张特大的8×10寸照给他监狱里的3K党弟兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna send a special 8 x 10 to his KKK buddies back in jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.68,1:17:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？这还是数码相片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, it's a digital photo too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.78,1:17:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们想怎么改就怎么改\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we can do whatever we want to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.68,1:17:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们弄好之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time we get done with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.45,1:17:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会出现在巴斯塔·莱姆斯的下一个音乐录影带里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gonna be in the next Busta Rhymes video on BET.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.12,1:17:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuck ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.22,1:17:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是有人权的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my rights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.72,1:17:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很担心 迈阿密方面动作频繁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried. There's too much heat around in Miami.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.69,1:17:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉的出来 感觉的出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it. I can feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.40,1:17:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得尽快把钱装进棺材 运往古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to put my money in coffins to Cuba faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.84,1:17:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫停尸房那边加快速度 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should tell the mortuary to speed things up. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.15,1:18:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面那个是水道标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the channel marker way out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.68,1:18:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大多在天亮时下货 但今晚有一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make the drop mostly at dawn, but there'll be one today, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.49,1:18:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你跟有没有跟妈妈联系过？她患了荨麻疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Syd, you talk to Mama? She's got hives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.00,1:18:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我还告诉了妈妈 你古巴男友的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I told Mama about your Cubano boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.77,1:18:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想请他来吃圣诞晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't invited to Christmas dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.67,1:18:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个电台吧 多一点音乐 少一点马克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change the station. More music, less Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.87,1:18:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你一回话 接下来的四十分钟 他便会说个没完没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you open the door he'll be a black Dr. Phil for the next 40 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.68,1:18:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 你最好别跟迈克太亲热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Syd, you might not want to get too flirty with Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.28,1:18:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你男朋友可能会切掉他的食指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boyfriend might cut off his trigger finger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.72,1:18:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许迈克一直在跟我拍拖 你有想过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Mike's been flirting with me. Did you ever think about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.06,1:18:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧花手迈克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trigger Mike?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.26,1:18:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别这样 别玩那小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like this. Don't play with that boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.56,1:18:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是认真的 别玩那小子 - 告诉他纽约的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously. Don't play with that boy. - Just tell him about New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.93,1:18:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说啊 - 告诉我什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do it. - Tell me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.80,1:18:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 糟糕 他下台阶了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Is he walking down the steps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.54,1:19:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕 他下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. He coming down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.37,1:19:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的 - 对 你真的搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - Yeah, you done fucked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.31,1:19:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回你可真的搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You done fucked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.78,1:19:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.32,1:19:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我去过纽约吧？记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember I went to New York? You remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.82,1:19:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.49,1:19:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 西德妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Syd."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.45,1:19:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我碰到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.22,1:19:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是西德妮碰到了我 就在纽约的某条大街上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Syd ran into me in New York on the street in that place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.73,1:19:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I said:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.06,1:19:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What's up?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.56,1:19:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那时饿了 所以后来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we was hungry, so then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.93,1:19:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她吃了点鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}she had fish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.97,1:19:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲈鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was grouper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.14,1:19:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我吃了点鸡肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I had some chicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.58,1:19:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我本该回家的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember I was supposed to come home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.11,1:19:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.11,1:19:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去约会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went out on a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.75,1:19:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是五次 现在我们又能见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, actually. Now we're seeing each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.82,1:19:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.02,1:19:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我真的很尊重你 马库斯 什么事也没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, really out of respect for you, Marcus, nothing happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.26,1:19:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 迈克 你为何拐弯抹角呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike, why you tripping, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.33,1:19:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意思是 我们得先确定 你能冷静面对这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we wanted to make sure you was cool with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.93,1:20:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 我怎么想并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter what I think, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.72,1:20:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 可我必须得这样发现你们的关系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I had to find out like this, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.10,1:20:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.30,1:20:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我问你 你们要生小孩吗？一小堆迷你迈克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you, y'all gonna have babies? Little bunch of mini Mikes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.51,1:20:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一堆只会撒谎 暴力的小混蛋吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bunch of little lying, violent motherfuckers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.71,1:20:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯 什么也没发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus, nothing happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.71,1:20:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说 妈妈一定会吓一跳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say, Mama's gonna be thrilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.02,1:20:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你知道吗？你得来点放松 或别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what, you need to "whoosah" or something for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.49,1:20:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 迪克西七号来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, here comes the Dixie 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.13,1:20:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 别理他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.39,1:20:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛那样子？- 不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why you acting like that? - Go on about your business, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.53,1:20:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得谈谈这件事 - 不 不 别挡在我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gonna talk about this. - No. Get out of my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.13,1:20:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一直想跟你谈 - 你放开我 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm trying to talk to you. - Get the fuck off me, Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.34,1:20:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该死的到底有啥毛病 啊？你干嘛总表现得那么愚蠢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is your problem, man?! Why you acting so stupid?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.31,1:20:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为这糟糕的搭档关系 所以我才表现的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a dysfunctionaI partnership. That's why I'm acting like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.64,1:20:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道 - 我们之间缺乏信任 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know - There ain't no trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.24,1:20:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't lie to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.71,1:20:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等待合适的时机告诉你 可那不是你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting for the right time to tell you. But that ain't your issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.12,1:20:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不挑明对我说 你对这事儿有何不满？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you bring it to me real. What is your problem with this?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.32,1:20:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 伙计？你是条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You a dog, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.62,1:20:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 是的 我说了 - 哦 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. There it is. I said it. - Oh, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.06,1:21:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像条发情的公狗 脑子里都是那样的东西 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like a pit bull with that little pink thing hanging out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.66,1:21:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是这样 哦 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's like that. Oh, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.73,1:21:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我配不上你老妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not good enough for your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.41,1:21:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩够了 船来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, enough. The boat's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.47,1:21:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们会解决那事的 继续干活吧 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We gonna handle that shit. Go ahead, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.38,1:21:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约一小时内 投货的船就会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}ln about an hour, the drop boat's gonna come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.83,1:21:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.04,1:21:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道那棺材会运往哪间停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonder what mortuary that coffin's going to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.29,1:22:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,笔直开过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going straight by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.73,1:22:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seeing what I'm seeing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.97,1:22:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把货送到停尸房 别搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the load to the mortuary and don't screw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.77,1:22:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.77,1:22:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,装货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.12,1:22:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.32,1:22:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车 停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.52,1:22:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要用你的车 行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your car. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.26,1:22:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 - 你能不能弄辆好点的车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out the car. - Can't you get a better car than that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.93,1:22:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那人走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let that man go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.20,1:22:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别用那种口气对我说话 - 神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be coming at me with that tone. - Freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.20,1:22:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小车不会破坏臭氧层 - 那辆才是我要的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Small cars don't hurt the ozone layer. - That's what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.60,1:22:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停车 - 下 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop the car. - Get Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.54,1:22:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打开后车厢 出来 你进去 - 下车 下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pop the trunk. Get out. Get in. - Get out. Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.61,1:22:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把你的屁股放进去 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get your ass in. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.18,1:23:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正在卖车呢 - 非得让我掏枪出来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am in the middle of a sale. - Do I have to pull my gun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.05,1:23:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 丹·马里诺 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Dan Marino. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.79,1:23:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后点 丹 嗨 真的是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up, Dan. Hey, you're the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.02,1:23:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要什么只管吩咐 警官 - 那是丹·马里诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whatever you need, officers. - That's Dan Marino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.45,1:23:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 退后 - 让我试试它的性能到底如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. Back up. - Let me know how it rides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.16,1:23:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会好好测试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna test-drive the shit out this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.56,1:23:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 我不想暴露自己的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. I don't want to blow my cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.17,1:23:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了 他们就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got them. Got them right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.42,1:23:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛非得开这么近？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you gotta get so close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.08,1:23:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会让那棺材脱手的 - 但四周都是他们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't let that coffin get away. - But they're all around us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.15,1:23:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 是那两个黑鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, those are the gangbangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.86,1:23:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 他们又不认识我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, they don't know us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.66,1:23:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 我们这里出了点状况 我们被人跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss, we got a problem here. We're being followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.66,1:23:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下麻烦大了 卡洛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a big problem, Carlos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.76,1:23:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 老板 我会处理的 - 宰了那些黑鬼 懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, boss. I'll take care of it, okay? - Kill those black bitches. All right?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.34,1:23:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们害死我们了 有卧底混进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made us. Get some undercovers to roll with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.17,1:24:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头行驶 大家到伯克斯特 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're splitting up. Everybody go to Third and Boxter, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.61,1:24:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.02,1:24:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没签生死状要卷入飞车追逐呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't sign up for no goddamned car chase!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.06,1:24:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you lost your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.81,1:24:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 我看你一心一意想干蠢事 所以请让我下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you got your mind set on doing dumb shit, so please let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.99,1:24:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的画面我只在电影中见过一次 不过他们没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seen this in a movie once. They didn't make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.93,1:24:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.64,1:25:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当心那卡车 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dump truck! - I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.58,1:25:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈克 - 我没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike! - I'm fine. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.48,1:25:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边 该死 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there! Oh, shit, Mike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.52,1:25:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到那该死的车了吗？- 不 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see that shit? - No shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.70,1:25:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹·马里诺绝对该买下这车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan Marino should definitely buy this car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.97,1:25:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这辆 这辆已经快被我撞烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this one. I'm fucking this one up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.77,1:25:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过绝对要这个款式的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}But definitely one like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.20,1:25:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我们要撞上了 要撞上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost missed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.47,1:25:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 差点搞砸了 我差点搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that was almost fucked up. I almost fucked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.45,1:25:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.32,1:25:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.06,1:26:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.37,1:26:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 引擎盖上有个死人 死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn! - Dead man on the hood! Dead man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.00,1:26:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我正在想办法甩掉 - 快甩掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm trying to get it off. - Get it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.75,1:26:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在想办法甩掉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.81,1:26:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那东西真够恶的 太恶心了 - 快甩掉 甩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That shit's nasty. That's nasty. - Get it off! Get…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.31,1:26:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shit is nasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.16,1:26:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 便衣警察 通通离开 - 便衣警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Undercover police! Everybody move! - Undercover police!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.10,1:26:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! - Move! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.78,1:26:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要转弯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming around the corner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.45,1:26:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 他们快到了 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready, they're coming around the block. Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.63,1:27:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up top!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.54,1:27:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.88,1:27:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要是我的车 我可就气炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, if this was my car, I'd be pissed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.81,1:27:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.32,1:27:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,想打破一周枪战世界纪录吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to break the world record for gun fights in a week!?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.26,1:27:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在这时候挖苦人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the time to criticize!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.49,1:27:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在埋怨我 我再也受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't work with you blaming me all the time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.89,1:27:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 难道这不是你的错？- 不是 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is not your fault? - This is not… No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.53,1:27:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯蛋 迈克 一切都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bullshit, Mike! Everything's your fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.84,1:27:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's go! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.35,1:28:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这儿没人了 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Clear around! - Cool!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.13,1:28:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going around!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.63,1:28:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈克 逮住他 - 他们把棺材运走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike, got him! - They got the coffin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.91,1:28:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.48,1:28:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 快闪 趴下 警察 都趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Get down! Police! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.09,1:28:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 快闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.46,1:28:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察 闪 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.33,1:28:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡路 闪 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.16,1:28:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.07,1:29:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 开门 警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Open the door! Police!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.27,1:29:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.01,1:29:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.58,1:29:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike! Mike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.49,1:29:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小子咬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boy bit me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.20,1:29:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.22,1:29:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.35,1:29:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.22,1:30:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察 闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.08,1:30:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在底下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He under there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.08,1:30:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追丢了棺材\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost the coffin…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.08,1:30:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你还把我们唯一的带路者给烤焦了 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you barbecued our only lead, Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.12,1:30:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当了一辈子警察 这是最惨 最痛苦的一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has got to be the worst, most emotional cop week of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.02,1:30:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是有点辛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's been a little rough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.50,1:30:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些尸体要运到哪去？- 不知道 这真的很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where were these bodies going? - I don't know. It's really strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.70,1:30:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现所有的尸体内部都是空的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the John Does we found out here are empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.17,1:30:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,空的尸体 还都很肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empty Does. Fat Does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.81,1:30:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,切开来 取走器官 再缝合起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut them open, took the organs out. Sewed them back up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.98,1:30:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.31,1:30:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把事情搞得越乱 我们看起来越像摇滚明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more you guys fuck up, the more we look like rock stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.42,1:30:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们追的车子是市立停尸房的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The van you was chasing is a transport for the city morgue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.22,1:30:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体要送往大学作医学研究用\N{\fnArial\fs30}The John Does were being delivered to the university for medical research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.26,1:30:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得太好了 - 我真不敢相信 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice going. - I can't believe you guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.66,1:31:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩早上是否有互打电话的习惯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you both wake up in the morning, call each other up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.49,1:31:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「早安 马库斯」 「早上好 迈克」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Good morning, Marcus." "Morning, Mike."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.43,1:31:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你好吗？」 「很好」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"How are you doing?" "A'ight."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.90,1:31:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那我们今天打算怎样捣毁局长的生活呢？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"So how are we gonna fuck up the captain's life today?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.03,1:31:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,「天啊 我不知道」 「我不知道」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Gee, I don't know." "I don't know."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.87,1:31:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你看 那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ooh. Look, over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.21,1:31:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来杀三个胖子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kill three fat people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.17,1:31:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再把他们丢在街上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave them on the street."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.51,1:31:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们压过之前他们早就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were dead before we ran over them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.51,1:31:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有死并不重要 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter whether they were dead or not, goddamn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.78,1:31:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次你们在街上放个尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time you leave a corpse on the street…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.85,1:31:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就得让这些法医人员来看看怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get these forensic coroner guys to come to see what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.13,1:31:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我得派调查人员来 瞧见没？他们在调查呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I gotta get detectives. See? They're detecting shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.96,1:31:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我还得叫这些人 把尸体装进该死的袋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I gotta get these forensic guys to stick them back in the fucking bag!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.37,1:31:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.80,1:31:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 你们就像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, you're like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.21,1:31:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一群吸血虱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a bunch of bloodsucking ticks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.81,1:31:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸干局里的生命之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}draining the life's blood out of this department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.55,1:31:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他的 局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn the whoosah, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.80,1:31:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你刚叫我虱子吗？- 我是在说他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you just call me a tick? - I was referring to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.48,1:32:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想是的 - 局长 这些不是正常的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thought so. - Captain. These aren't normal corpses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.45,1:32:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我把你从辆急驰的冷冻货车里扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I threw you out of a speeding ice truck…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.82,1:32:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再辗过你的头 你也不会正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then ran over your head, you wouldn't be normal either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.06,1:32:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想一想 这些尸体的内脏被掏干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about this for a second. These bodies have been emptied…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.23,1:32:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而它们又属于碰巧开了停尸间的毒贩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a drug smuggler that just happens to own a mortuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.47,1:32:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我有一大堆尸体 里头有很多空间的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a bunch of bodies waiting with plenty of room in them…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.54,1:32:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能走私物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could smuggle some shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.24,1:32:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼·塔皮亚有着完美的掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Tapia has the perfect cover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.64,1:32:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼·塔皮亚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Tapia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.51,1:32:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我要立刻拿到搜查令 去搜他的停尸间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a warrant to go into his mortuaries immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.15,1:32:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不 不行 理由呢？理由呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No warrant. What? For what? For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.25,1:32:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他们送一堆死人去作医学研究？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a bunch of dead guys on their way to med research?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.15,1:32:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 每次我们追捕他 他总能告赢我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Every time we go after him, he sues us and wins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.22,1:32:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事到此为止 否则他们会炒了我们 解散TNT小组\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shit stops now or they'll fire us, disband TNT…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.49,1:32:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我装进该死的棺材\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stick me in a fucking coffin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.70,1:32:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这事到此为止 - 那「不惜代价」是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is over now! - What happened to "whatever it takes"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.03,1:32:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为那是场车祸大屠杀 更不用说强尼·塔皮亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was pre- vehicular manslaughter. Not to mention Johnny Tapia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.17,1:32:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那儿到底怎么是了？- 哦 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck is that? - Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.94,1:33:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 闭嘴 闭嘴 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up. Shut up. Shut up. Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.68,1:33:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 这人侵犯了我的人权\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man has violated my rights!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.35,1:33:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死那人又是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.12,1:33:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们压死人还不够吗？现在还扯上绑架？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Running people over is not enough for you? Now you're into kidnapping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.02,1:33:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人是个罪犯 明白吗 局长？我们抓住了他 就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man is a criminal. Okay? We busted him at the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.52,1:33:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我已经快被搞死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, I have so much brass up my ass…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.86,1:33:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有人要为我唱国歌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be playing "The Star-Spangled Banner."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.86,1:33:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也无能为力了 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't cut out for this, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.07,1:33:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 伙计 我现在不想和你吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. I can't do this with you right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.40,1:33:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在重新评估什么才更重要 - 关于什么？要不要当警察吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm re-evaluating what's important. - About what? Being a cop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.61,1:33:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是关于你做我搭档的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, about you being my partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.64,1:33:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为西德妮吗？老天 嗨 马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about Syd? God! Hey, Marcus, man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.88,1:33:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那事你做的是不对 但不是因为它 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was messed up, but that ain't what this is about, Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.98,1:33:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我们去抓塔皮亚 你我就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we nail Tapia, you and me, we're over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.09,1:33:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经签了我的调职书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already signed my transfer papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.79,1:33:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅根 带你去看电影的小子叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Megan, what's the name of this boy taking you to the movies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.63,1:33:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.90,1:33:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 拜托你待会儿别问他一大堆问题 而令我难堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, please don't embarrass me and ask him a lot of questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.24,1:33:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道你是警察 这让他们都很紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows you're a cop, and it makes people nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.17,1:34:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛紧张？他犯罪了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why nervous? He on crack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.78,1:34:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事吧？- 没事 进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's cool? - Yeah. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.61,1:34:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.68,1:34:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我获准秘密搜查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a sneak and peek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.52,1:34:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛克莱法官说我们今晚可以去停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judge Sinclair said we can go into the mortuary tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.25,1:34:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能碰任何东西 但万一我们找到什么的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't touch nothing, but if we find something…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.66,1:34:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我们开正式的搜查令\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll give us a righteous warrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.49,1:34:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总喜欢惹毛霍华德局长 是不是啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You love pissing Captain Howard off, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.26,1:34:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.16,1:34:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几时开始打高尔夫的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when you start playing golf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.93,1:34:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你想调职的事是认真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so you real serious about this transfer thing, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.10,1:34:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你已经十年没干那行了 我刚一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you been quitting for 10 years. I just always thought it was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.87,1:34:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎样来应付那些破事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you dealt with all this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.84,1:34:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样对我和我的家人来说才最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what's best for me and my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.21,1:34:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我去拿我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm gonna get my stuff, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.07,1:35:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一同狂飙 生死与共\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We ride together, we die together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.71,1:35:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远的坏小子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad boys for life."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.51,1:35:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们越来越老了 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We getting old, Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.15,1:35:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小子要来约我的宝贝女儿 出去过她的首次约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them young punks coming to take my baby out on her first date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.65,1:35:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这混球是谁？- 嗨 伯内特先生 我是雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the fuck are you? - Hi, Mr. Burnett. I'm Reggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.99,1:35:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你来做什么？- 我来带梅根出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you doing here? - I came to take out Megan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.33,1:35:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我来带梅根出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - I came to take out Megan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.83,1:35:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你几岁？- 十五岁 伯耐特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old are you? - I'm 15, Mr. Burnett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.00,1:35:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 你看起来像三十岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker, you look 30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.57,1:35:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我看看你的证件 - 我没带在身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Show me some lD. - I don't have none on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.70,1:35:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没带证件 给我靠墙站好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have no lD. Get your ass up against that wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.84,1:35:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有何毛病？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.17,1:35:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,自以为无所不知的小霹雳猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you know it all. Little young Thundercats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.18,1:35:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 身上有大麻吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got joints on you? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.51,1:35:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你吸毒吗？- 不 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You smoke that shit? - No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.25,1:35:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算让我女儿兴奋吗？你有没有吸毒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to get my daughter high? Do you smoke that shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.02,1:35:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老弟 门口那人是谁？- 雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nigga, who that is at the door? - It's Reggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.42,1:35:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 雷吉是谁？- 来带梅根出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the fuck is Reggie? - Came to take Megan out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.36,1:36:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想干嘛 小子？- 我来带他的女儿出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you want, nigga? - I'm here to take his daughter out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.36,1:36:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么？- 雷吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name? - Reggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.86,1:36:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到这混蛋说你叫雷吉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the motherfucker say your name Reggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.06,1:36:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在要带梅根出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taking Megan out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.33,1:36:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你几岁了？- 15岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old is you? - Fifteen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.93,1:36:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 小子 你至少有30岁了 - 这位是迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit, nigga, you at least 30. - This is Mike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.37,1:36:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会打架吗？- 会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you fight? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.74,1:36:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会打架？混帐 你会打架 好 我倒要看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can fight? Motherfucker. You can't fight. Look at you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.97,1:36:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说了 - 我想知道如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cut it out. - I want to know if…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.04,1:36:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要带我的侄女出去 我要知道他会不会打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}When somebody taking my niece out, I want to know if he can fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.21,1:36:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有人会过来找麻烦 如果小子不会打架 她就脱不了身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody might come say something, the nigga can't fight, she can't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.58,1:36:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是梅根的教父 知道吗？他刚出狱不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Megan's godfather, okay? He just got out the joint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.45,1:36:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛把我的事抖出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you putting all my business in the street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.05,1:36:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们叫他 - 我刚出狱 我可不想再回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They call him… - I got out of jail. I ain't going back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.32,1:36:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't going back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.72,1:36:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？害怕了？以前没见过枪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you? You're scared. You ain't seen a gun before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.26,1:36:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿枪指着那小子 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop pointing the gun at the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.93,1:36:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 少在别人面前不尊重我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, don't you disrespect me in front of company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.77,1:36:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪收起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the gun go off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.10,1:36:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你是个又高又笨又大 长相滑稽的混蛋 是不是啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nigga, you a big, tall, Ludacris- looking motherfucker, ain't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.87,1:36:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会饶舌吗？- 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You rap? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.68,1:36:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.45,1:36:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在听好了 10点01分送我女儿回到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen. Have my daughter home at 10:01.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.35,1:37:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果10点01分她还没到家 我会上车去找 懂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she ain't home at 10:01, I'm in the car, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.52,1:37:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上枪 找到你 然后把你的屁股打烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock, loaded and hunting your motherfucking ass down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.76,1:37:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听见我的话没？- 说啊 我会跟他一块追\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you hear me? Speak up. - I'll go with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.19,1:37:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我出马的话 晓得情形会怎样吗？嚓嚓砰砰 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm there, know what it'll be? Chitty Chitty Bang Bang, nigga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.36,1:37:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就会像那样 - 马库斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what it'll be. - Marcus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.16,1:37:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷吉 宝贝 真对不起 原谅梅根的爸爸和他的笨搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reggie, baby, I am so sorry. Forgive Megan's dad and his silly friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.43,1:37:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是处男？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You a virgin? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.77,1:37:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续保持下去 今晚不准乱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it that way. Ain't gonna be no fucking tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.34,1:37:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 这件红衬衫真不错 祝你们玩得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, the red shirt's nice. You guys have a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.27,1:37:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟男人上过床吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ever made love to a man? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.34,1:37:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想吗？- 不想 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to? - No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.28,1:37:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 玩开心点 宝贝儿 - 走吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, have a good time, baby. - Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.88,1:37:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - We need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.78,1:37:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.82,1:37:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好破这个案子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you ready to bust this case open?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.89,1:37:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是的 让我们打个漂亮仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Let's finish strong. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.63,1:37:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小姐们 今晚是我们最后的机会了 为了抓住塔皮亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, ladies. We cannot take a burn tonight or Tapia walks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.34,1:37:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得干得干净利落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a good, clean break- in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.17,1:37:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扎克 侦查哨就位了？- 已经就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zank, eyeball. - Eyeball set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.21,1:38:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 德克斯 到高地了？- 已经上屋顶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dex, high ground. - Rooftop set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.85,1:38:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凡诺蒂 点着你的大麻烟 - 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fanuti, light your crack pipe. - Got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.75,1:38:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗克曼 仪器都好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lockman, you buzzing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.12,1:38:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就绪 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're up, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.26,1:38:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？有人在吗？- 我们是来送尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, anybody home?! - We got a stiff to deliver!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.03,1:38:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 伙计？- 我们是来送尸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on here, man? - We got a stiff to deliver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.20,1:38:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里没有人要过尸体 - 那家伙现在在车上 他刚死不久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody told me about any stiff. - The guy's in the van now. He's fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.57,1:38:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们不接受尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}No deliveries tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.01,1:38:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫我们直接来这里的 就是这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told us to come right over to the place. This is the place.{\r}
