Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.72,1:38:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说要送到西班牙棕榈殡仪馆的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said to get it to the Spanish Palms Mortuary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.19,1:38:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说的？你这个拉丁傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you dumb Latin fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.86,1:38:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大麻抽多了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you smoking in that crack pipe?{\r}
