Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.06,1:40:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这位兄弟还没进行防腐处理 - 你说什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This dude hasn't been embalmed yet. - What you talking about?{\r}
