Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.87,1:40:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要把所有的洞都堵上 因为死人常常会放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got to get it all out because a lot of times dead people'll fart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.64,1:40:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样会把所有参加葬礼的人都熏跑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That shit'll clear a funeral home out.{\r}
