Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.65,1:40:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.59,1:41:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不需要先热热身吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even gonna warm up to it?{\r}
