Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.96,1:52:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有搜查令 - 我们有卧底在里面 必须让她先出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have a warrant to get in there. - A UC's inside. She's gotta leave first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.33,1:52:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们两分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.66,1:52:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打她手机 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call her on her cell. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.87,1:52:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把房子的电源切断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the power to the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.40,1:52:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到她了吗？- 快点啊 还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got her? Well, let's go. - No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.84,1:53:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里有情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a bogey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.01,1:53:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了你 约瑟夫 还有我和母亲俄国\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. This is for you, Josef, and me and Mother Russia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.69,1:53:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是什么强盗 而是真的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gangbanger homeys. They're cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.49,1:53:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.16,1:53:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是来抢我们的货的 我看他们在保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't trying to hit the load. I think they were looking after her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.91,1:53:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你老实告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you tell me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.37,1:53:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 窃听器在哪儿？- 他们识破她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- where is the wire? - They made her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.84,1:53:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要把她救出来 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get her out. Go! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.71,1:53:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 塔皮亚 你该死的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Tapia, you fucking mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.36,1:53:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄国的家伙来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian Grim Reaper is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.19,1:53:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有东西都应该在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.63,1:53:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 该死 - 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit. - Goddamn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.63,1:53:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视的 前两个小时有人进出停尸房吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyeball, has anything left this mortuary in the past two hours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.70,1:54:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个葬礼车队刚离开 我们一直跟踪到迈阿密港\N{\fnArial\fs30}A four-hearse funeral just left. We trailed them to Miami Harbor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.77,1:54:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈阿密空警 塔皮亚想把钱运去古巴 调直升机来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miami Air, Tapia's running his money to Cuba. Get us a chopper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.98,1:54:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 塔皮亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Tapia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.79,1:54:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕我吗？你这个狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared of me, you little scumbag?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.16,1:54:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有麻烦了 - 把车转到后面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got some heat. - Pull the car back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.89,1:54:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该死的要杀了你 你该死的算老几？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fucking kill you! Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.13,1:54:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下武器 - 放下武器 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drop the weapon! - Drop the weapon now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.40,1:54:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你们一边的 - 放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm with you guys! - Put it down, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.17,1:54:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在这 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm over here! - Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.07,1:54:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下武器 - 我要杀了那狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drop the weapon! - I'll kill that son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.35,1:54:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是A组 我们将和B组还有海岸警卫队会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Alpha. Heads up to the Coast Guard Sharks and Bravo Team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.45,1:54:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭港口 拦住任何行动中的船只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close the harbor. Freeze any moving speedboat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.82,1:54:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是B组\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Bravo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.02,1:54:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现一条形迹可疑的快艇 正在离开港口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a go- fast slinging a high rate of speed down Miami harbor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.12,1:54:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住这船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.94,1:55:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想甩掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy's moving us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.61,1:55:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们朝大桥下开去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we're going for the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.48,1:55:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,海岸警队 我们上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coast Guard, we're going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.91,1:55:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈阿密警察 立即停船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miami Police. Shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.98,1:55:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是警察 立即停船\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the police. Shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.16,1:56:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意 他们有武器 - 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out, he got a weapon. - Bail out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.90,1:56:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,海岸警卫队 准备射击 烧了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coast Guard, take him down. Burn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.44,1:56:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,船已被截停 船已被截停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vessel is dead in the water. Vessel is dead in the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.85,1:56:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们要干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.46,1:56:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man, it's full up. It's full up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.19,1:56:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次是正义的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a righteous bust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.74,1:56:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么跑掉的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell they slip away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.54,1:56:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我接监视警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the watch commander on the horn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.81,1:56:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她哥哥在迈阿密警察局吗？把他找来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know her brother on Miami PD? Find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.21,1:56:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道谁会来救你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know anyone who might want to save your life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.39,1:57:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 马库斯 他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Marcus, they…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.92,1:57:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿了我一亿美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have $ 100 million of mine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.73,1:57:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你48小时内给我还回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I want it back in 48 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.08,1:57:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit just got real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.85,1:57:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克斯·奈尔 美国毒品缉查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Snell, DEA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.99,1:57:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾梅斯特工 联邦调查局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Eames, FBl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.99,1:57:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们刚告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has just informed me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.33,1:57:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星监测到 二十分钟前 塔皮亚的飞机进入了古巴领空\N{\fnArial\fs30}that satellite pinpointed Tapia's jet in Cuban airspace 20 minutes ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.83,1:57:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,古巴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuba?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.70,1:57:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国的政策是不和绑架者谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}United States does not negotiate with hostage- takers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.14,1:57:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是古巴的绑架者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially Cuban hostage- takers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.34,1:57:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的情况很棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a delicate situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.44,1:58:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是什么情况 她是我妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not just a situation. This is my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.11,1:58:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,国家的所有机构都在通过非正式途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the record, all State Department agencies…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.18,1:58:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,以外交方式解决问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}are using their back-channel contacts for a diplomatic solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.35,1:58:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道 当外交途径办完事后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, by the time y'all finish being diplomatic…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.69,1:58:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妹妹可能已经死了 这都他妈是废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}my sister could be in a fucking box. This is bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.48,1:58:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会轻易放过他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't getting away from us that easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.56,1:58:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一同狂飙\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ride together…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.93,1:58:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,生死与共\N{\fnArial\fs30}we die together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.60,1:58:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都是坏小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad boys for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.38,1:59:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己动手 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta do it ourselves, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.27,1:59:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.81,1:59:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看起来你们要干蠢事了 我也加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you're about to do something stupid. I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.48,1:59:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还不知道 我们这些前三角洲部队队员有多厉害吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dodd tell you how crazy us ex-Delta guys are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.38,1:59:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兄弟 蒂多 住在古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother, Tito, lives in Cuba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.38,1:59:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有点疯狂 但他和反抗军有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a little crazy, but he's hooked up with the underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.65,1:59:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器 人员 还有躲避的地点 我们正需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons, men, a safe house. Whatever we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.56,1:59:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再考虑什么护照之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can forget about passports and all that stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.93,1:59:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一旦古巴方面抓到咱们 咱们都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if the Cubans catch us, we're all dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:59.23,2:00:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兄弟是地下反抗卡斯楚的组织A66的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother Tito's in Alpha 66, the Anti- Castro Underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.13,2:00:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟塔皮亚有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that have to do with Tapia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.47,2:00:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有 塔皮亚是卡斯楚最大的毒品资金的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything. Tapia's the biggest supplier of drug cash to Castro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.94,2:00:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以地下组织也反对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Alpha 66 will be all over him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.07,2:00:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 现在时机再好不过了 他说马上就能安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, that is perfect. He says he can get men on the tunnel right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.41,2:00:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me holler at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.41,2:00:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂多 我们需要地图 隐蔽地点 还有其他所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tito, we need layout, security, the whole deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:20.78,2:00:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到情报塔皮亚明天下午4点有批货要进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got info that Tapia's got a casket coming in tomorrow at 4:00 p.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.29,2:00:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这是进去的好机会 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that might be our way in. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.63,2:00:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们带来了个帮忙的 是CIA的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brought you a little care package from my friends over at the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.76,2:00:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要来帮助 别问我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to help. And don't ask me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.93,2:00:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're spies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.44,2:00:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,前三角洲情报和爆破专家 申请加入行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Former Delta Intel and Demo. Requesting permission to tag along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.69,2:01:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗尼 听说古巴湾外有一条船抛锚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ronnie, I hear there's a boat on fire off the coast of Cuba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.19,2:01:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以在国际水域帮助他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we break international waters to help them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.96,2:01:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.97,2:01:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,得破釜沉舟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point of no return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.20,2:01:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从心底感谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to thank y'all from the bottom of my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.04,2:01:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈克 听着 - 等我回去再跟我说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike, look, I just… - Tell me when we get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:24.15,2:01:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标进入 我看见那艘船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The target's in sight. I see the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.15,2:01:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 目标正前方 300码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger. Target 12 o'clock. 300 yards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.49,2:01:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门 准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roper in the door. Stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.63,2:01:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,下 下 下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.87,2:01:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蒂多？- 欢迎来到古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tito? - Welcome to Cuba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.36,2:02:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,和塔皮亚对门也算是的隐蔽地点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. What's up with the safe house across the street from Tapia's crib?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.33,2:02:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是最安全的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last place anyone would look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.37,2:02:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在监视他的大宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been watching the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.10,2:02:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫兵们每天下午3点半准时踢足球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards play soccer each day at 3:30.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.14,2:02:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息是 所有人都知道他用正规军当他的个人保镖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad news, everyone knows he uses the army like his bodyguards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.21,2:02:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是塔皮亚的住宅区 - 是CIA的东西吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Tapia's compound. - CIA hooked us up, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.72,2:02:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最尖端的激光雷达技术 甚至能看到他的逃跑地道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. This LIDAR laser technology even shows his escape tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.32,2:02:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,报警系统一直连到军队营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alarm security is wired to the army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.09,2:02:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们行动前不把这个安全设施炸掉 就麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're screwed if we don't blow up this security room before we make a move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.93,2:02:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己挖的地道四通八达\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tunnel we're digging branches off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.89,2:02:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条通到他家后院 另外一条通到他的逃脱通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}One under his back yard and the other into his escape tunnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.63,2:02:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们动作要快\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta hurry up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:51.64,2:02:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我跟你说我弟弟是个疯子吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? I told you my brother was a maniac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.74,2:02:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得怎么样？- 让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How we looking? - Let me check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.43,2:03:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 你长得像耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papi, you look like Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.26,2:03:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么叫这 最后的晚餐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why they call this The Last Supper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.77,2:03:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们在耶稣受难前 最后一次共进晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the last time they were all together before Jesus was crucified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.67,2:03:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,上十字架？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crucified?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.68,2:03:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把耳朵堵住 嗨 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your ears. Hey, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.51,2:03:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太该死的消沉了 明白不明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. This is fucking depressing! You understand?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.82,2:03:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该死的是谁的想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, who had this fucking idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.95,2:03:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要美丽的小天使看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want little angels looking down on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.92,2:03:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是海滩 离塔皮亚的家只有300码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here's the ocean, 300 yards from Tapia's house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.29,2:03:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这儿 隐蔽地点 第一条通道在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here. Safe house. First tunnel comes through to here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.10,2:03:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一组拿掉安全设施\N{\fnArial\fs30}First team takes out the security station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.80,2:03:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二通道直达房子的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second tunnel comes through into the center of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.04,2:04:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂多 你的内线说西德妮在最后一个卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tito, your contacts inside said Syd's in the last bedroom…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.57,2:04:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二层 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the second floor, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.11,2:04:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比是我们的人 如果她说你妹妹在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lupe's one of us. If she says your sister's there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.71,2:04:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她就一定在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}she is there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.91,2:04:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,三点整 一大袋的猫和蜥蜴会被仍过铁丝网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three o'clock sharp, the bag of cats and iguanas go over the fence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.98,2:04:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这会让安全人员烦躁并关掉报警系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully the motion detectors'll go so crazy security'll shut them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.55,2:04:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的人将在外面掩护 防止军队进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guys will watch the outside for any military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.42,2:04:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一来 就麻烦大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they come, that's bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.77,2:04:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们努力成功吧 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's make this count, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.33,2:04:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.21,2:05:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 这已经是今天的第五次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, it's the fifth time today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.72,2:05:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡洛斯 把行动探测仪关了 等修好再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlos, turn off the motion sensors till we get it fixed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.46,2:05:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看 爸爸 我找到了一只猫 我可以养它吗？- 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look what I found. Can I keep them? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.96,2:05:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.49,2:05:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 探测器停止工作了 时间到了 - 开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- sensors are down. Time to move. - We are 100% go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.86,2:05:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.41,2:05:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,左 左 啊 比看起来难多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left. Left. Yeah. There we go. This is not as easy as it looks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.07,2:06:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们到路口了 分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're at the T. Split right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.34,2:06:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝好运 兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.68,2:06:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.29,2:06:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来找足球场 用用你的鼻子 宝贝儿 把它找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the soccer game. Sniff it out, baby. Sniff it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.00,2:06:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左 往左 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the left. To the left. Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.27,2:06:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你们别看到我 别看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you did not see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.78,2:06:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们准备好攻入逃脱通道了 - 好 这里是足球场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ready to bust into the escape tunnel. - There we go. Soccer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.73,2:07:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.33,2:07:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走走走 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.09,2:07:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.32,2:07:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个美国婊子抓下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the American bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.16,2:07:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,给桑托司将军打电话 我需要他 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call General Santos. Tell him I need him now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.16,2:07:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 宝贝儿 把她带到安全地带 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, darling. Take her outside to safety. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.92,2:08:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡洛斯 情况不妙 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carlos, this is not good! - I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.25,2:08:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 桑托司将军呢？- 老板 他快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is GeneraI Santos?! - He's coming, boss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.59,2:08:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这帮美国佬 我要把你们脑袋打掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking maricons! I'm gonna blow your head off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:21.20,2:08:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.93,2:08:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这枪怎么了？我儿子会把你们煮了吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened to this gun? My son will slice you into chorizo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.40,2:08:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老妈 抱歉了 - 你这个混小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mama, I'm very sorry. - You little puta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.05,2:08:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维加斯 进来了吗？- 我们把母亲和小女孩都抓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vargas, you in? - We got Mama and the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.58,2:08:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要进屋了 冲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're entering the house. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.33,2:08:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.72,2:09:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都清理了 我们最多还有30秒 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's clear outside. You got 30 seconds max. Haul ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.52,2:09:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳台上有两个 我打不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got two rovers on the balcony. I can't get a shot off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.53,2:09:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见了吗？我没打中\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the rover? I missed him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.97,2:09:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬下 爬下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! Get down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:36.57,2:09:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趴下 - 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down! - Down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.38,2:09:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.78,2:09:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马库斯 - 来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Marcus! - Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:44.58,2:09:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我们救到人质了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! We got the package.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.55,2:09:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要加快 情况越来越紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move now. It's turning into a real bad day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.29,2:09:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维加斯 我们要出来了 掩护我们 - 我们掩护你 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vargas, we're coming back. Cover us! - We got you covered, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.40,2:10:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁告诉我情况怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody talk to me. What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.47,2:10:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The military is everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.11,2:10:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糟了 我们要走了 - 听着 我们这来了很多敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is bad, I have to go. - Listen, you have a lot of company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.42,2:10:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.09,2:10:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我中弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hit! I'm hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.96,2:10:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,去地道 我把它炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head for the tunnel. I'll blow this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.80,2:10:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.95,2:10:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 你们必须出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, you gotta get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.39,2:10:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,维加斯 撤 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vargas! Get out! Abort!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.89,2:11:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有时间去地道了 改用B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't reach the tunnel! Go to plan B.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.13,2:11:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们现在实行B计划 - 什么B计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're going to plan B! - What plan B?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.23,2:11:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来不注意听讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't pay attention to shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.86,2:11:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- B计划是什么？- 那是你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the plan B? - That's your problem!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.83,2:11:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑？你们能不能闭嘴 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you fucking shitting me? Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:09.97,2:11:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟着我 跟着我 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow me! Follow me! - I will…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.73,2:11:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划 什么是B计划？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B? What the hell is plan B?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.64,2:11:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蒂多 你在这里干什么？- 你需要一个古巴向导 傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tito, what you doing here? - You need a Cuban guide, fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.14,2:11:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:22.15,2:11:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没法到地道 - 咱们撤出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They won't make it to the tunnel. - Let's blow out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.88,2:11:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙 钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys, keys, keys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.77,2:11:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天哪 不 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! No! God! Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:52.01,2:11:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划里可没考虑到敌人会有机枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B did not have that big- ass gun in it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.34,2:11:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管这个叫B计划？B计划是指的什么？狗屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this plan B?! What the plan B stand for? Bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.11,2:11:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要自己开车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to drive?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:59.35,2:12:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 就停在那些开着机枪的混蛋们旁边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, pull over by the fuckers with the machine guns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.02,2:12:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.13,2:12:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,想杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not to be fucked with!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:16.07,2:12:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车通过餐厅的时候 我错过了那帮人的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed the part of the meeting when you drive through the dining room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.94,2:12:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后正好冲出前门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right out the front door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.99,2:12:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.83,2:12:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是古巴军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuban army was everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:02.51,2:13:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带我们去关塔那摩湾 - 不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gotta get us to Guantanamo Bay! - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.31,2:13:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能冒然开车进入美国海军基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't drive onto a U.S. Naval base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.42,2:13:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're Americans, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.42,2:13:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,马库斯 你知道平常我们碰到这种情况时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus, you know how when we usually get in these situations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.63,2:13:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是会想方设法让你感觉好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm always trying to make you feel better, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:17.89,2:13:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我们会逢凶化吉一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like we'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.36,2:13:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 是啊 - 我本也可以说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah. - I could say it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.40,2:13:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但大家都知道那只是胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that'd be a bunch of bulIshit today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.14,2:13:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,军队 军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military, military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.65,2:13:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走哪边？哪边？- 不 右边 右边 向右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which way?! - No, right! Right! Go right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.29,2:13:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是毒贩子们的老窝 是他们制造毒品的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are drug dealer shacks. They make cocaine here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.16,2:13:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望那里有会爆炸的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope there's shit in there that likes to blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.37,2:13:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我要杀了你们这些狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster! I'll kill you, motherfucker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:59.84,2:14:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要冲过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:01.17,2:14:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这山该死的真高 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a big-ass hill. - Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.25,2:14:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这也是B计划的一部分吗？- 不 这是C计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, shit! Is this still called plan B? - No, this is definitely plan C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:50.22,2:14:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 耶稣啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.71,2:15:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God! God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.54,2:15:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 开始还击啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody start shooting at somebody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.98,2:15:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot! Shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:24.15,2:15:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 我没子弹了 - 我还有两颗子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shit! I'm out! - I got two rounds left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:27.32,2:15:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪膛里还有一颗子弹 - 我没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One in the chamber. - I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:29.09,2:15:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多枪 难道一颗子弹都没有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these guns and none of you got no bullets?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:31.59,2:15:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我屁股里还有一颗 - 哦 天啊 他中弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got one in my hip! - Oh, God, he's hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.30,2:15:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边 关塔那摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}There! Gitmo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:40.47,2:15:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国领土 宝贝儿 美国领土\N{\fnArial\fs30}U.S. soil, baby. U.S. soil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:42.77,2:15:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:45.34,2:15:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 美国人来了 - 哦 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Americans on the way! - Whoa, watch…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.35,2:15:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲过去 冲过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run it! Run it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.50,2:16:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.38,2:16:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.02,2:16:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:39.23,2:16:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.55,2:17:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're Americans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.58,2:17:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们纳过税了 射他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pay my motherfucking taxes! Shoot them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.92,2:17:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的外国佬 放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fucking gringo. Drop the gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.52,2:17:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪 放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down! Put it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.66,2:17:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们帮不了你了 你会留在古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't help you. You're staying in Cuba.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:23.57,2:17:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在站在雷区\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are standing on a live minefield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.34,2:17:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.58,2:17:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 为什么我们不都回家去呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, why don't we all go home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.92,2:17:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我们回家 你去旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll go home, you go to a hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.58,2:17:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这笔帐以后再算 今天我们都占不了便宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work this shit out another day. None of us is having a good day right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.76,2:17:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把枪给我 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the gun! - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.29,2:17:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把枪扔到你的脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll toss it right at your feet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:43.23,2:17:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就扔在那颗地雷的旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}right next to the mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:41.45,2:18:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就该那样开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's how you supposed to shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.92,2:18:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 你就该那么开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, that's how you shoot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:48.09,2:18:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我希望我的下一任搭档也能那样开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I want my next partner to shoot just like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:51.13,2:18:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有功能紊乱的混蛋才能正好射中人家的脑门\N{\fnArial\fs30}It take a dysfunctionaI motherfucker to bust somebody in the head like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.80,2:18:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是功能紊乱的表现之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some dysfunctionaI shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.87,2:18:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我还希望下一个搭挡 会请我去参加他的家庭烤肉会\N{\fnArial\fs30}My next partner'll invite me to his barbecues, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:59.77,2:19:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 姑娘 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, girl. Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.11,2:19:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我大老远跑来古巴就是为了这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came all the way to Cuba for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.88,2:19:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.21,2:19:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们非得在这些地雷中间干这个吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all gotta do that around land mines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:17.12,2:19:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能告诉他们 在地雷中间干那个很危险吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you tell them that that shit is dangerous around these land mines?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.54,2:19:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？迈克 承认这个对我来说很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Mike, this ain't easy for me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.48,2:19:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我确实是错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.97,2:19:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会因为你跟我妹妹约会 感到骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be very proud for you to date my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.04,2:19:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 伙计 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, man. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:44.11,2:19:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我和西德妮曾考虑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, me and Syd thought about it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.32,2:19:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时候你的行为是那么疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your behavior was so crazy that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.62,2:19:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每次都想尝试 可最后还是决定最好不告诉 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}any magic we could've captured, probably best if we didn't… You know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.42,2:19:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是准备占我妹妹的便宜吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna take advantage of my little sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:56.29,2:19:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你已经伤了她的心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already you breaking her heart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:57.99,2:20:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么呢？- 她对你来说还不够好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What you talking about? - She not good enough for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:00.93,2:20:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德妮 迈克说你狗屁不如\N{\fnArial\fs30}Syd, Mike says you ain't shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:03.50,2:20:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要这么大声地说些屁话呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why would you scream out some crazy nonsense like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.64,2:20:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你到我家来 在我的新泳池里对我不敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't appreciate you coming here, disrespecting me in my new pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:11.47,2:20:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新泳池是我出钱买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought your new pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:12.94,2:20:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不把这泳池挂在你的法拉利后面拖走呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you hook this pool up to your Ferrari and drag it out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:17.95,2:20:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我是在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, I was joking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.62,2:20:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 就在此时此地 你该问问你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And second of all, all this right here, smell yourself right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:22.85,2:20:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为此时此刻你又开始发疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this moment is what's wrong with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.25,2:20:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的调职信还在废纸篓里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the transfer papers in the trash can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.79,2:20:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他们拼起来粘好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get them and glue them the fuck up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.29,2:20:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 粘起来 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glue them up. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:31.69,2:20:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 需要胶水吗？- 我们以后不会再是搭档了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want some glue? - We won't be partners no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.76,2:20:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我车里有胶水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got glue in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.96,2:20:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正试图跟你好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.95,2:20:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,太热了 我觉得自己就好像要被煮熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hot, I feel like I'm cooking in this fucker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.90,2:20:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我还得在这儿听你说屁话？那首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I gotta hear shit out of you? Then on top of that shit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.10,2:20:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢骗我的妹妹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you gonna dog my baby sister?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:48.58,2:20:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 该死的又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this that bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.05,2:20:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.59,2:20:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:58.79,2:21:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还留着保单 我还留着保单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept the warranty. I kept the warranty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:19.91,2:21:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计 你得去背背歌词了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you gotta learn the words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.44,2:21:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克 你不也不知道那该死的歌词吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, you don't know the damn words either.{\r}
